<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>07 / 试卷与生涯</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>一对一 AI 助教：分层记忆与工具边界</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#1E7BE0' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>设计中</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28, flex: 1 }}><Box style={{ width: 620, justifyContent: 'center' }}><svg width={620} height={400} viewBox='0 0 620 400'><rect x='0' y='0' width='620' height='400' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#E3E8EF' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='0' y='0' width='620' height='40' rx='8' fill='#0E2340'/><rect x='0' y='26' width='620' height='14' fill='#0E2340'/><text x='16' y='26' font-size='15' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>StudyAgent</text><rect x='18' y='58' width='584' height='26' rx='4' fill='#F5F7FA'/><text x='30' y='76' font-size='14' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>个人助教 · “今天应该复习什么？”</text><rect x='18' y='92' width='584' height='52' rx='6' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#7A8699' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='4 4'/><text x='30' y='124' font-size='14' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='start' font-weight='400'>结合明天课时 / 到期复查 / 近期错误推荐任务</text><rect x='18' y='152' width='584' height='52' rx='6' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#7A8699' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='4 4'/><text x='30' y='184' font-size='14' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='start' font-weight='400'>记忆分层：原始记录 / 结构化状态 / 确认信息 / 待验证事项</text><rect x='18' y='212' width='584' height='28' rx='14' fill='#EAF3FD'/><text x='30' y='231' font-size='14' fill='#1E7BE0' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>权限：不读其他学生记忆；考试模式限制提示与答案工具</text><rect x='18' y='248' width='584' height='34' rx='17' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='310.0' y='271' font-size='15' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>安排训练 · 生成变式 · 保存复测计划</text><text x='608' y='390' font-size='12' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='end' font-weight='400'>示意占位 · S29</text></svg></Box><Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>界面要点</Text><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 9 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>为每名学生提供持续陪伴的助教，能查生涯记录、记住已确认目标、训练安排、常见困难与有效帮助方式。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>MCP 工具能力五类：查询课程关系 / 查询本人学习记录 / 解题教学与步骤批改 / 查找错题与生成变式组卷 / 保存计划与复测安排。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>长期记忆不是把所有聊天永久塞入提示词，也不是把学生个人信息写进模型权重。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>事实、学生自述、教师判断、模型推测分别记录。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>统一任务预算与停止条件：达到目标、用完约定时间、继续练习无新增证据、需教师确认；未知或未完成不因任务关闭自动记为掌握。</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ marginTop: 6, padding: '9px 14px', background: '#F5F7FA', borderRadius: 6, alignSelf: 'flex-start' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>示意占位 S29 · 待替换为实际截图</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：试卷与生涯维度设计思路.md §9</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 75 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>